From 0f473471d9fd179555d568c5bb8670c21063014e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 07:12:21 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] test(kernel): pin a Solidcraft design with a blend face

Build a .sc fixture from the sample design: its final body is a block
with one variable round, which the record keeps as a `blend` surface.
The import keeps the blend face, the modeller's volume, an enclosing box,
and the machining mesh is closed and within 0.005 mm.

The test passes on upstream/main b13f790ec without a code change: the
solidcore pin moves (PR #2797, PR #3802) brought Surface::Blend.

Refs #2578

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
